Core\BetaFence.lua
# Brief SH1: the Share your finds text, pure; UI\Share.lua shows it.
Core\Share.lua
Core\RealmCheck.lua
Core\Quests.lua
Core\QuestFlags.lua
# Brief GF5: the predicted quest facts' reader, after Core\QuestFlags.lua whose client title its namer
# asks first; its provider and namer register after every other one, so a fact of ours always wins.
Core\QuestsPredicted.lua
# Brief IC1: the predicted item sources' reader, after Core\QuestsPredicted.lua whose page keys it reads;
# its provider registers after every other one, so a source of ours always wins.
Core\ItemsPredicted.lua
Core\Discoveries.lua
Core\BossLoot.lua
# Brief PR29: the nearest vendor for the Sold by header's "Show nearest" button. Reads
# Core\EraSources.lua, Core\ForeverVendors.lua and Core\Sources.lua at call time.
Core\Nearest.lua
# Brief S8: the trainer search ("t:lw", "trainer:hunter") the search box asks. Reads the Classic Era
# table, the Creatures and PlayerSources modules and the places store at call time.
Core\TrainerSearch.lua
# Brief IT1: ItemTreeAPI, the read only public API, after Core\Keep.lua and every module it reads.
Core\API.lua

